---
import { withBase } from "../../data/site";
---

<aside
  class="welcome-toast"
  data-welcome-toast
  hidden
  aria-live="polite"
  transition:name="lab-welcome"
  transition:persist
>
  <header class="welcome-toast-header">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Quick Start</p>
      <h2>Welcome to Lab OS</h2>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="welcome-close" data-welcome-close aria-label="Close welcome">
      <span aria-hidden="true">x</span>
    </button>
  </header>

  <ul class="quick-start-list">
    <li>Dock switches apps.</li>
    <li>Command Palette launches pages, actions, and settings.</li>
    <li>Settings controls theme, background, and motion.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="welcome-actions">
    <button type="button" class="button button-primary" data-command-palette-open>Open Palette</button>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href={withBase("settings/")} data-app-link="settings">Open Settings</a>
  </div>
</aside>
